


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_34a68a9b:


    "把粥也吃干净后，火锅派对也差不多走到了尾声。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_307f6150:


    "恋人们相亲相爱，而好友则伴其左右。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_b46a28d2:


    "两位原天使在稍远处温柔地守望着这一切。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_46b7f341:



    voice "2MI_0461"
    miyako "「喝醉了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_8ca11901:



    voice "2SA_0329"
    sachiko "「有点。你能看出来？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_af4ec800:



    voice "2MI_0462"
    miyako "「因为你看起来很舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_d8355019:


    "祥子微醉。一个人把一升的酒给喝了一半，能到这种程度还算是不错的酒量吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a750c0b9:



    voice "2SA_0330"
    sachiko "「酒虽好，但让人舒畅的原因是我在看着她们」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_43b79e2c:



    voice "2MI_0463"
    miyako "「啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_6f4c55cf:



    voice "2SA_0331"
    sachiko "「像一群傻瓜吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_cc9b9165:



    voice "2MI_0464"
    miyako "「傻瓜吗……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_3f9c8083:



    voice "2SA_0332"
    sachiko "「会因为无聊的事情又笑又哭。喜怒无常地浪费着每一天」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_f5ac4496:



    voice "2SA_0333"
    sachiko "「但是，无论在周围的人看来是多么地无聊，对那两个人来说都是努力度过的人生」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a904278f:



    voice "2SA_0334"
    sachiko "「非常甘甜又有些苦涩的故事的主人公们。现在，她们是看不到故事之外的。彼此就是世界的全部了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_9cb80f3b:



    voice "2MI_0465"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_83021856:



    voice "2SA_0335"
    sachiko "「这是醉汉的诗词。不用认真听」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_d637ae51:



    voice "2MI_0466"
    miyako "「不……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_cf493c3b:



    voice "2SA_0336"
    sachiko "「总而言之啊，坠入恋爱之中的话，脑子里都是对方，其他的一切都会被忘记」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_0edb11eb:



    voice "2MI_0467"
    miyako "「感觉的洪水……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a63f9004:



    voice "2SA_0337"
    sachiko "「对。非常巨大的洪水。恋爱简直就是天翻地覆」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_38b5e8e8:



    voice "2MI_0468"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_00363191:


    "圣夜子再次盯着情侣看。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_7f6967cf:



    voice "2SA_0338"
    sachiko "「羡慕吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_d1aa04e6:



    voice "2MI_0469"
    miyako "「是啊。我也想体验一次」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_1ca0a605:



    voice "2SA_0339"
    sachiko "「像你这样好看的女生很快就能找到恋人的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_50e53cb2:


    "——这句话刺中了谁的胸口？"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_7c0024af:



    voice "2MI_0470"
    miyako "「你——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_f55e0eed:



    voice "2SA_0340"
    sachiko "「还炫耀——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_8ffa7ab2:


    "祥子好像是为了躲避圣夜子的发问一样地朝着那三人开玩笑地说。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_78abbf7d:



    voice "2RI_0582"
    rin "「呜哇，搞啥！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_cbed910b:



    voice "2HI_0570"
    hina "「一身酒臭！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_58c163c3:



    voice "2FU_0493"
    fumi "「呀，是谁在摸奇怪的地方？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_34e6b3d2:



    voice "2SA_0341"
    sachiko "「呵呵呵」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_daae5262:



    voice "2HI_0571"
    hina "「喂—！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_6e9d29ef:


    "一阵慌乱之中阳菜的脚踢到了柜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_5ce33132:


    "然后，有什么像是个四方形板子的东西从柜子上掉了下来。是画板。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_78ee4217:



    voice "2SA_0342"
    sachiko "「啊好疼！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_469b784e:


    "画板砸到了祥子背上，转了几圈之后滚到了圣夜子的膝盖边。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_67ede7f8:



    voice "2MI_0471"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_bd114b3a:


    "圣夜子拿起正反颠倒的画板。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_e1250122:



    voice "2SA_0343"
    sachiko "「啊，那个是不能看的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_51eae0c9:



    voice "2MI_0472"
    miyako "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a33d1f07:


    "太晚了。画板已经被翻了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a156b4d4:


    "上面画的是身穿制服的少女的肖像。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_20a71ede:



    voice "2MI_0473"
    miyako "「这是，我……吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_486d3d5c:


    "圣夜子将画给在一起的四人看。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_d0946003:



    voice "2HI_0572"
    hina "「是圣夜子」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_ffb83505:



    voice "2SA_0344"
    sachiko "「哎呀……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_be741437:


    "画板上画的少女和抱着画板的少女看上去是同一个人。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a6cc45a9:



    voice "2FU_0494"
    fumi "「笑得很开心呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_3a6fbed3:


    "画板上的她脸上是大大的笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_ea0a6153:



    voice "2RI_0583"
    rin "「画得很用心」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_154026b2:


    "和刚才大家看到的画相比这幅给人的感觉相当不同。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_55f4dece:


    "虽然非常朴素，但是也正因为如此它才变成了一副向人强而有力地诉说着什么的绘画吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_300b370e:



    voice "2SA_0345"
    sachiko "「不……那个，这个是」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_8e5e1b34:


    "动摇的祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_fb459b1e:



    voice "2FU_0495"
    fumi "「圣夜子，你不知道这幅画吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_96195e7d:



    voice "2HI_0573"
    hina "「并没有做过模特？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_f34edbfb:



    voice "2MI_0474"
    miyako "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_ec7cabc2:



    voice "2RI_0584"
    rin "「也就是说，盗摄？罪犯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_267de3c3:



    voice "2SA_0346"
    sachiko "「我才没犯罪啊！我是凭着记忆画的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_8b93fbf0:



    voice "2RI_0585"
    rin "「你都把圣夜夜的身体看到了能记在脑子里的程度了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_bee2fae6:



    voice "2SA_0347"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_3b2aed38:



    voice "2RI_0586"
    rin "「而且在想象中是裸体——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_3d1d65dc:



    voice "2SA_0348"
    sachiko "「这又不是裸体画！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_34ed093a:



    voice "2RI_0587"
    rin "「啊，原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_d387c222:



    voice "2HI_0574"
    hina "「想都没想过？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_384e89a8:



    voice "2SA_0349"
    sachiko "「想一想又没啥吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_f9576b04:



    voice "2HI_0575"
    hina "「不要想啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_76d6295e:



    voice "2SA_0350"
    sachiko "「思想·信仰的自由！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_344f4437:



    voice "2FU_0496"
    fumi "「但是，只画了圣夜子，太狡猾了吧～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_b4ace5b7:


    "文很敏感。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_e3d7f34d:



    voice "2FU_0497"
    fumi "「这幅画里是不是有种酸酸甜甜的感觉？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_bfe9a122:



    voice "2SA_0351"
    sachiko "「小、小文，我随时也可以给你画哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_3ee87398:



    voice "2FU_0498"
    fumi "「裸体是不行的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_2ec54b72:


    "三人面对祥子罕见的反应热闹了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_61b13116:



    voice "2MI_0475"
    miyako "「……………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_ddfa311f:


    "圣夜子有些开心。她把画板抱在胸前。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a_dcd3c087:



    voice "2MI_0476"
    miyako "「……诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a_9c0407ab:


    "圣夜子在自己抱住的画板的后侧发现了一排小字。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_a_9ce1748a:


    "然后她吃了一惊。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_b_8ae9231e:



    voice "2MI_0477"
    miyako "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_b_d3da5226:



    voice "2SA_0352"
    sachiko "「收回！这个画板要收回了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_b_7027f594:


    "祥子红着脸慌慌张张地拿走画板，再次把它放到了柜子上。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_13_b_64230433:



    voice "2MI_0478"
    miyako "「…………」"
